@startuml
|Lecturer|
start
:Access quiz editing interface;

|EditQuizPage|
:Request quiz details;

|QuizController|
:Fetch quiz details;

|QuizService|
:Retrieve quiz details;

|QuizController|
:Return quiz details;

|EditQuizPage|
:Provide quiz details for editing;

|Lecturer|
:Modify question text, options, categories, and points;

|Lecturer|
:Save or discard changes;

if (Save changes?) then (yes)
    |EditQuizPage|
    :Confirm save;

    |QuizController|
    :Persist updated quiz details;

    |QuizService|
    :Save updated quiz details;

    |QuizController|
    :Confirm changes saved;

    |EditQuizPage|
    :Display changes saved confirmation;
else (no)
    |EditQuizPage|
    :Discard edits and return to quiz list;
endif

|Lecturer|
stop
@enduml
